# Tables (E6, docs/desktop/WEBVIEWER_ENGINE.md#tables), block geometry only: a
# table with a border, padding, border-spacing, captions above and below, a
# column with a width and a cell spanning two columns; width="" shared out
# by preferred widths; a cell spanning two rows growing them in proportion;
# vertical-align top, middle and bottom in a table with a height; the footer
# group laid out last and the header group first; a table in a cell;
# align="right", align="center" beside that float and a table in <center>;
# a percentage column; and cells with no table around them. Laid out at 800
# by 600; every box but the anonymous ones matches Chromium's
# getBoundingClientRect at the same size.
